<div id="page">

<!-- ========== MASTHEAD ========== -->
<div class="masthead">
  <div class="masthead-text">
    <h1>Akbar Ali</h1>
    <div class="toplinks">
      <a href="mailto:akbar.ali@iitgn.ac.in">Email</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp;
      <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=g-2Aix8AAAAJ&hl=en" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Scholar</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp;
      <a href="https://github.com/aamaanakbar" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp;
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/aamaanakbar" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp;
      <a href="https://x.com/AamaanAkbar" target="_blank" rel="noopener">X</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp;
      <a href="memories.html">Memories</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp;
      <a href="files/CV.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CV</a>
    </div>
    <p>I am a fourth-year Ph.D. student in Computer Science and Engineering at
      <a href="https://iitgn.ac.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">IIT Gandhinagar</a>, advised by
      <a href="https://iitgn.ac.in/faculty/cse/shanmuganathan" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Prof. Shanmuganathan Raman</a>.
      I lead an independent research line on <strong>generative priors for image restoration</strong> &mdash;
      latent inversion in StyleGAN and diffusion models, zero-shot and training-free restoration,
      and 2D/3D Gaussian splatting for hyperspectral imaging.</p>
    <p>My work sits deliberately across disciplines. I collaborate with computer scientists, earth scientists
      and agricultural researchers, and I have built and released datasets that serve all three.
      I am currently a Visiting Researcher at the
      <strong>Helmholtz Institute Freiberg (HZDR)</strong>, Germany, on the Research Lab Abroad
      Fellowship under the Visvesvaraya PhD Scheme (MeitY).</p>
    <p>Before IIT Gandhinagar, I was a Project Associate at
      <a href="https://www.iitrpr.ac.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener">IIT Ropar</a> on hyperspectral-stereo
      fusion for industrial volume estimation. I hold an M.Tech (2nd rank) and B.Tech (1st rank) in CSE
      from <a href="https://aliah.ac.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Aliah University</a>, Kolkata,
      and a UAV Pilot Licence for platforms up to 25 kg.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="masthead-photo">
    <img src="files/aamaan1.png" alt="Akbar Ali" width="240" height="240">
  </div>
</div>

