<!-- ========== PROJECTS ========== -->
<section id="projects">
  <h2>Collaborations and Field Leadership</h2>
  <div class="entries">

    <div class="entry">
      <div class="entry-when">Feb 2024 &mdash; Jan 2025</div>
      <div class="entry-what">
        <div class="entry-title">3D Geophysical Image Translation using GANs</div>
        <p>A year-long collaboration with geoscientists, translating 3D geophysical scans into photorealistic virtual outcrop geology.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="entry">
      <div class="entry-when">Jun 2023 &mdash; Jan 2024</div>
      <div class="entry-what">
        <div class="entry-title">Smart farming of cotton using aerial imagery &mdash; COT-AD</div>
        <p>Designed and ran a six-month acquisition campaign with agricultural researchers, flying weekly missions at 10 m, 15 m and 115 m. I owned the flight schedule, the multi-altitude protocol, and the resulting dataset.</p>
        <div class="figure-wide">
          <img loading="lazy" src="files/gif_cotton.gif" alt="Cotton growth monitoring">
          <figcaption>Weekly flights tracking one field through a full growth cycle.</figcaption>
