        <div class="entry-title">3D Vision Summer School &mdash; <a href="https://www.iiitb.ac.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">IIIT Bangalore</a></div>
        <p>Week-long school on deep learning for 3D vision. The Gaussian splatting sessions here shaped the direction my hyperspectral work took afterwards.</p>
        <div class="figure-pair">
